
# Keep this directory in git
# This folder will contain runtime logs generated by T3RN Executor
# 
# Files that will be created here:
# - executor.log (main execution logs)
# - balance_report.txt (balance monitoring)
# - mev_transactions.json (MEV detection data)
# - network_stats.json (network statistics)
# - execution_summary.txt (execution reports)
#
# Note: Log files are automatically ignored by .gitignore for security
